  "***LEVEL 3: MOVING SCAFFOLDS 1 ***": {
    "translation": "第3小关 - 移动平台1"
  },
  "***ZOMBIES ARE COMING***": {
    "translation": "僵尸正在靠近"
  },
  "????? :That you won't !!!": {
    "translation": "????? - 休想!!!"
  },
  "BOY CLOUD : !? they're the humans !?": {
    "translation": "云小子 - !?他们就是人类!?"
  },
  "BOY CLOUD : Hey !! I and my friends will defeat you humans !!": {
    "translation": "云小子 - 喂!我和伙伴们会打败你们这些人类!"
  },
  "BOY CLOUD : If I will be able to defeat you...": {
    "translation": "云小子 - 只要我能打败你们......"
  },
  "BOY CLOUD : It's very proud for me too!!": {
    "translation": "云小子 - 那我也会很自豪!"
  },
  "BOY CLOUD : My father said human is getting our place...": {
    "translation": "云小子 - 爸爸说,人类正在侵占我们的领地......"
  },
  "BOY CLOUD : My father will praise me !!": {
    "translation": "云小子 - 爸爸一定会表扬我的!"
  },
  "BOY CLOUD : Nuwaaaaaaaa!! My best speedddddd!!!!!": {
    "translation": "云小子 - 呜哇啊啊!这就是我的最快速度!!!"
  },
  "BOY CLOUD : Shoot me !! if you can follow my speed !!": {
    "translation": "云小子 - 跟得上我的速度,就尽管开枪吧!"
  },
  "BOY CLOUD : So!!! I need to defeat you at this time !!": {
    "translation": "云小子 - 所以,这次我一定要打败你们!"
  },
  "BOY CLOUD : Too hot!! keep away it from me !!": {
    "translation": "云小子 - 太烫了!快把它拿远点!"
  },
  "BOY CLOUD : What's this wind !? I can't do the best of speed !!": {
    "translation": "云小子 - 这是什么风!?我没法全速移动了!"
  },
  "BOY CLOUD :Ahhh...They...really...strong...!!!": {
    "translation": "云小子 - 啊......他们......真的......好强......!"
  },
  "BOY CLOUD :HEY DAD !! PLEASE DEFEAT THEM !!!!!!!!": {
    "translation": "云小子 - 爸爸!求你打败他们!!!"
  },
  "BOY CLOUD :Hey humans !!": {
    "translation": "云小子 - 喂,人类!"
  },
  "BOY CLOUD :I can't trust you even my father trust you !!": {
    "translation": "云小子 - 就算爸爸相信你们,我也不会相信!"
  },
  "BOY CLOUD :I couldn't beat you humans...": {
    "translation": "云小子 - 我没能打败你们这些人类......"
  },
  "BOY CLOUD :Please defeat them !! We will help you !!": {
    "translation": "云小子 - 请打败他们!我们会帮你的!"
  },
  "BOY CLOUD :TAKE MY FINAL ATTACK !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!": {
    "translation": "云小子 - 接下我的最后一击!!!"
  },
  "BOY CLOUD: Ahh!! remember this things !!!!!!": {
    "translation": "云小子 - 啊!你们给我记住!!!"
  },
  "CAUTION :It can use only once": {
    "translation": "注意 - 只能使用一次"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER : and I want to fight with you too.": {
    "translation": "云父 - 而且,我也想与你们交手。"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER : Can we fight without kidding...?": {
    "translation": "云父 - 我们能认真地打一场吗......?"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER : hehehe...": {
    "translation": "云父 - 呵呵呵......"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER : I think you want to experience the more hard.": {
    "translation": "云父 - 我想,你们还想挑战更高的难度。"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER : Is which a winner...?": {
    "translation": "云父 - 究竟谁会获胜呢......?"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER : Remember your items can't effect me !!": {
    "translation": "云父 - 记住,你们的神器对我无效!"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER : Welcome humans.": {
    "translation": "云父 - 欢迎你们,人类。"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER : You are our hero,thanks....": {
    "translation": "云父 - 你们是我们的英雄,谢谢......"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :...Me? don't worry I was made of water.": {
    "translation": "云父 - ......我?不用担心,我是水做的。"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :...So you should use it in other area.": {
    "translation": "云父 - ......所以,你们可以在其他区域使用它。"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :Alright...finally you defeat me,you won.": {
    "translation": "云父 - 好吧......你们终于打败我了,你们赢了。"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :Can you survive !?": {
    "translation": "云父 - 你们能活下来吗!?"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :Don't take hand for them !!": {
    "translation": "云父 - 别对他们下手!"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :Hey! Humans !! I will help you !!": {
    "translation": "云父 - 喂,人类!我来帮助你们!"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :Hey... You are very strong....": {
    "translation": "云父 - 看来......你们非常强大......"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :Humans,we don't know he is really dead.": {
    "translation": "云父 - 人类,我们还不知道他是否真的死了。"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :I couldn't defeat him,because he was very stronger than me.": {
    "translation": "云父 - 我没能打败他,因为他比我强大太多。"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :I hope he is dead...": {
    "translation": "云父 - 但愿他已经死了......"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :I think...": {
    "translation": "云父 - 我想......"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :I'm giving the power to you...": {
    "translation": "云父 - 我正在将力量交给你们......"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :If you was in at that time...we could save my...": {
    "translation": "云父 - 如果那时你们也在......我们就能救下我的......"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :IRASSYAI MASE": {
    "translation": "云父 - 欢迎光临!"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :It seems your power is true...": {
    "translation": "云父 - 看来,你们的实力确实不假......"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :LOOK !!": {
    "translation": "云父 - 看好了!"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :Oh,please pretend you didn't hear that.": {
    "translation": "云父 - 哦,请当作没听见刚才那句话。"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :oh... I'm defeated..": {
    "translation": "云父 - 哦......我输了......"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :ok,Humans time to change your area...!": {
    "translation": "云父 - 好了,人类,该前往下一个区域了!"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :Pick up me !! I will attack him !!!": {
    "translation": "云父 - 把我捡起来!我来攻击他!"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :So please defeat him instead of me...": {
    "translation": "云父 - 所以,请替我打败他......"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :Take care if you go anymore.": {
    "translation": "云父 - 如果还要继续前进,一定要小心。"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :This injured will fix soon.": {
    "translation": "云父 - 这点伤很快就会恢复。"
