  "CLOUD FATHER :Time to show my high power...": {
    "translation": "云父 - 是时候展示我的真正力量了......"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :You can complete other area even you have it.": {
    "translation": "云父 - 带上它,你们也能通过其他区域。"
  },
  "CLOUD FATHER :you can defeat him...": {
    "translation": "云父 - 你们能打败他......"
  },
