  "CRASHER : hahahahHAHAHAHAHHHAHHAHAhHHHHHAAHAHA": {
    "translation": "键盘破坏者 - 哈哈哈哈哈哈哈!!!"
  },
  "CRASHER : You can't kill me forever !!!!": {
    "translation": "键盘破坏者 - 你们永远也杀不死我!"
  },
  "CRASHER :BANZAIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIII !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!": {
    "translation": "键盘破坏者 - 万岁——!!!"
  },
  "CRASHER :HAHAHA !!! You can't kill me whatever you do anything !!!!!!": {
    "translation": "键盘破坏者 - 哈哈哈!不管你们做什么,都杀不死我!"
  },
  "CRASHER :HAHAHA!!! What's the taste of this !!!?!?!?!": {
    "translation": "键盘破坏者 - 哈哈哈!这一招的滋味怎么样!?"
  },
  "CRASHER :It's over !!!!!!!!!!!!! HAHAHAHAHAHHAHHHHHH !!!!!!": {
    "translation": "键盘破坏者 - 结束了!哈哈哈哈哈!!!"
  },
  "Girl CLOUD : !? Not my father made !! ! I was made it myself !!": {
    "translation": "云女孩 - !?这可不是爸爸做的!是我自己做的!"
  },
  "Girl CLOUD : A,Anyway !! you will be defeated by this machine!!": {
    "translation": "云女孩 - 总、总之!这台机器一定会打败你们!"
  },
  "Girl cloud : Ahh!! Please move !!": {
    "translation": "云女孩 - 啊!快动起来呀!"
  },
  "Girl CLOUD : Ahh... I was taught by him a little...": {
    "translation": "云女孩 - 啊......他确实教了我一点......"
  },
  "Girl cloud : AHHHHHHHHHHHH !!": {
    "translation": "云女孩 - 啊啊啊啊啊!!!"
  },
  "Girl CLOUD : but... I prepared the machine for you": {
    "translation": "云女孩 - 不过......我还为你们准备了一台机器。"
  },
  "Girl CLOUD : Guh...you are stronger than I thought...": {
    "translation": "云女孩 - 唔......你们比我想象中更强......"
  },
  "Girl CLOUD : LOOK THE MY MACHINE !!!!": {
    "translation": "云女孩 - 看看我的机器吧!!!"
  },
  "Girl CLOUD : What do you think about this machine ?": {
    "translation": "云女孩 - 你们觉得这台机器怎么样?"
  },
  "Girl cloud : What...? Why can't move !?": {
    "translation": "云女孩 - 什么......?为什么动不了了!?"
  },
  "Girl CLOUD :?? My machine is strong from wind!! that can't effect me !!": {
    "translation": "云女孩 - ??我的机器很抗风,这招对我没用!"
  },
  "Girl CLOUD :Can't move finely !! Is engine colding !?": {
    "translation": "云女孩 - 机器动不了了!引擎被冻住了吗!?"
  },
  "Girl CLOUD :I couldn't beat you too...": {
    "translation": "云女孩 - 我也没能打败你们......"
  },
  "Girl CLOUD :Stop it !! Engine will be burning !!": {
    "translation": "云女孩 - 住手!引擎要烧起来了!"
  },
  "Girl CLOUD: Fight me !!": {
    "translation": "云女孩 - 来和我战斗吧!"
  },
  "Girl CLOUD: I will defeat you !!": {
    "translation": "云女孩 - 我一定会打败你们!"
  },
  "Girl CLOUD: I'm boy cloud's sister!": {
    "translation": "云女孩 - 我和云小子是兄妹!"
  },
  "Girl CLOUD: I'm stronger than you and father are thinking!!": {
    "translation": "云女孩 - 我比你们和爸爸想象中更强!"
  },
  "Girl CLOUD: You defeated my brother and come this place right?": {
    "translation": "云女孩 - 你们打败云小子后,才来到这里,对吧?"
  },
  "Remember : 10 COUNTS !!!!!": {
    "translation": "记住 - 总共10次!!!"
  },
  "TWO CLOUDS :but...": {
    "translation": "两朵云 - 但是......"
  },
  "TWO CLOUDS :My Father will defeat you instead of us !!": {
    "translation": "两朵云 - 爸爸会替我们打败你们!"
  },
  "WARNING : ZOMBIES ARE ALIVE !!!": {
